hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"200","We are Abu Yahya Muhammad bin Abdul Rahim Al-Bazzaz, we are Ibrahim bin Abi Al-Layth, we are Ubaid Allah bin Ubaid Al-Rahman Al-Ashja’i, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Al-Suddi, on the authority of Abd Khair, on the authority of Ali, “He called for a jug of water, then he performed a light ablution, then wiped his shoes,” then He said: “This is the ablution of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, for the pure person, as long as he did not do it.”"
